<div class="content">
    <h2>Payment Confirmation</h2>
    
    <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
    
    <p>Thank you for your payment! We've successfully processed your transaction. Here are the details:</p>
    
    <div style="background: rgba(249, 250, 251, 0.7); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #4f46e5;">Payment Details</h3>
        <p><strong>Transaction ID:</strong> {{transactionId}}</p>
        <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{paymentDate}}</p>
        <p><strong>Amount:</strong> {{amount}}</p>
        <p><strong>Payment Method:</strong> {{paymentMethod}}</p>
        <p><strong>Status:</strong> <span style="color: #10b981; font-weight: 500;">Completed</span></p>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <h4>Items Purchased</h4>
            <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">
                {{#each items}}
                <li style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
                    <strong>{{this.name}}</strong><br>
                    <span style="color: #6b7280;">{{this.description}}</span>
                    <div style="text-align: right;">{{this.amount}}</div>
                </li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: right;">
            <p><strong>Subtotal:</strong> {{subtotal}}</p>
            <p><strong>Tax:</strong> {{tax}}</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.1em; font-weight: 600;">Total: {{total}}</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <p>You can view and download a PDF copy of this receipt from your <a href="{{receiptUrl}}" style="color: #4f46e5;">account dashboard</a>.</p>
    
    <p>If you have any questions about your payment, please contact our billing team at <a href="mailto:{{billingEmail}}" style="color: #4f46e5; text-decoration: none;">{{billingEmail}}</a>.</p>
    
    <p>Thank you for choosing {{appName}}!</p>
    
    <p>Best regards,<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
    
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 30px;">
        This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email. If you have any questions, please contact our support team.
    </p>
</div>
